      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The latest outing of LOU WILL NZ (1) was a write off when he locked wheels, copped a flat tyre and raced wide. Was going well prior, missing narrowly in a Winter Gift heat here two back to follow a Newcastle win. Should get every chance from the inside draw. RIVERA LOU (3) could be close to a win having come from wide barriers to place in his last three outings here. The longer distance is some query but he is well served by a better barrier as is SNAP SHOT NZ (4) who has performed well to finish fourth from wide barriers in her last two outings here. TITIAN RAIDER (7) missed narrowly after racing parked last week and came from this barrier to win here three back. IM ROCKIN IT (2) could be close to a win and should get his chance from a low draw.",
